# Bank Management Console App

A simple Java console-based Bank Management System developed as a beginner-level mini project. This application allows users to check their account balance, deposit money, and withdraw money through a menu-driven interface.

## Features
- Check account balance
- Deposit money
- Withdraw money
- Validate deposit and withdrawal amounts
- Prevent withdrawals exceeding the available balance
- Exit the application

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Scanner
- Loops
- Switch Statement
- Conditional Statements

## Purpose
This project demonstrates basic Java programming concepts and provides practical experience in building a menu-driven console application.
